      "下": [
        {
          "id": "u1",
          "title": "Unit 1 It's a Nice T-shirt",
          "words": [
            { "en": "T-shirt", "cn": "T 恤衫" },
            { "en": "dress", "cn": "连衣裙" },
            { "en": "shirt", "cn": "衬衫" },
            { "en": "skirt", "cn": "短裙" },
            { "en": "jacket", "cn": "夹克衫" },
            { "en": "sweater", "cn": "毛衣" },
            { "en": "nice", "cn": "漂亮的" },
            { "en": "new", "cn": "新的" },
            { "en": "red", "cn": "红色的" },
            { "en": "blue", "cn": "蓝色的" },
            { "en": "yellow", "cn": "黄色的" },
            { "en": "green", "cn": "绿色的" },
            { "en": "cake", "cn": "蛋糕" },
            { "en": "name", "cn": "名字" },
            { "en": "game", "cn": "游戏" }
          ],
          "lesson": "Look and Say\nLook at my T-shirt. It's nice.\nLook at my dress. It's new.\n\nListen and Say\nA: Hi, Andy. Look at my new T-shirt.\nB: Wow, it's nice! I like it.\nA: Look at Lily's dress. It's nice too.\nB: Yes, her dress is beautiful.\n\nStory Time\nAndy has a red T-shirt.\nLily has a yellow dress.\nTom has a blue shirt.\nSue has a green skirt.\nThey all look nice!\n\nPhonics: a_e\ncake  name  game  make\nThe letter a says /eɪ/ in these words.",
          "lessonCN": "看一看，说一说\n看看我的 T 恤衫，很漂亮。\n看看我的连衣裙，是新的。\n\n听一听，说一说\nA：嗨，Andy。看看我的新 T 恤衫。\nB：哇，真漂亮！我喜欢它。\nA：看看 Lily 的连衣裙，也很漂亮。\nB：是的，她的连衣裙很美。\n\n故事时间\nAndy 有一件红色 T 恤衫。\nLily 有一条黄色连衣裙。\nTom 有一件蓝色衬衫。\nSue 有一条绿色短裙。\n他们看起来都很好看！\n\n自然拼读：a_e\ncake（蛋糕）  name（名字）  game（游戏）  make（做）\n在这些单词里，字母 a 发 /eɪ/ 的音。"
        },
